# The raw dataset - 1.35 GB, and cited by DOI rather than redistributed.
# Run src/clean.py for the download instructions and the checksum to verify it.
data/raw/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Word's lock file, created while a document is open
~$*.docx

# Kept in the repository on purpose:
#   src/              the code
#   data/processed/   the cleaned sample and predictions (7.6 MB) so the analysis
#                     can be re-run without the 1.35 GB download
#   outputs/models/   the four trained models. The random forest is 505 MB and is
#                     stored through Git LFS; retrieving it needs `git lfs` installed.
#                     Without LFS you get a small pointer file instead of the model.
#   outputs/figures/  the 15 charts
#   outputs/tables/   the result tables
#   notebooks/        the walkthrough
